    A["Validated staged release enters install or upgrade; see sender.distribution and sender.build"]
    B{"Platform"}
    C["Linux requires root, supported architecture, recognized private root and exclusive install lock"]
    D{"PVE host"}
    E["Native PVE x64 rejects existing sys-agent; prepare or reuse PVE credentials and CA under token lock"]
    F["Linux Docker requires Compose v2 and no active or enabled native sender"]
    G["Preserve existing MQTT settings; otherwise create private settings"]
    H["Back up deployment files and pin prior Docker image when present"]
    I["Compiled installer detects target and checks readiness; isolated native onefile and FIFO coordinate repeated interrupts and final status"]
    J{"Deployment"}
    K["Compose builds and starts sys-agent with host identity and optional override"]
    L["Native installer preserves recognized service and override, then replaces executable"]
    M["Check container running with stable PID and restart count over three samples"]
    N["Check effective service command and active stable PID over three samples"]
    O["Native commits after stable service; successful native status commits root inputs before marker; Docker commits after stable marker"]
    P["Attempt restoration of deployment files and prior container or service state on failure or early cancellation"]
    Q["Retain backup and image or service recovery data if rollback fails; manual recovery may be needed; hard kill and power loss are not covered"]
    R["Windows requires elevated x64 PowerShell, trusted paths and Visual C++ runtime"]
    S["Preserve existing protected MQTT settings or create them before activation"]
    T["Recognize and export prior task, stop if running and swap package"]
    U["Download pinned LHM and PawnIO via GitHub asset API with SHA-256 checks; reuse PawnIO at least 2.0; register SYSTEM startup task"]
    V["Start task and require running state for five seconds; commit source marker"]
    W["On failure restore package and prior task XML and running state where possible"]
    X["Preparation side effects can persist: PVE identity and CA, Docker, Windows driver and settings"]
    Y["Runtime status uses service, container or task manager; MQTT sender_version uses embedded Linux version or validated Windows manifest, null when unknown; public update is manual"]
